c4 Buccaneer Bay — System Context
active-tag Crew

tag Technology as tech
  React blue
  Node.js green
  PostgreSQL purple
  Redis red
  Python yellow
  Kafka orange
  Parchment gray

tag Crew as crew
  Captain red
  Purser green
  Navigator purple
  Bosun orange
  Monkeys yellow

tag Risk as risk
  Mutiny red
  Squall orange
  Drizzle yellow
  Calm green

Captain is a person crew: Captain
  description: Sets course, books berths
  -Books berths on-> Dock Board
Quartermaster is a person crew: Purser
  description: Settles tolls, splits treasure
  -Settles tolls on-> Toll Desk
Navigator is a person crew: Navigator
  description: Plots routes from tide charts
  -Plots routes on-> Dock Board

Tide Almanac is a system crew: Navigator
  description: Outside tide and weather forecasts
Crown Customs is a system crew: Purser
  description: The Crown's duty office
Treasure Bank is a system crew: Monkeys
  description: Holds the shared doubloons

Harbor Authority is a system crew: Captain
  description: Runs berths, manifests and tolls
  containers
    Dock Board is a container crew: Navigator
      description: Berth console
      -Calls over HTTPS-> Manifest API
    Toll Desk is a container crew: Purser
      description: Duty and toll console
      -Calls over HTTPS-> Manifest API
    Manifest API is a container crew: Captain
      description: Core API for berths and tolls
      -Stores manifests in-> Harbor Ledger
      -Caches tides in-> Chart Cache
      -Files duties with-> Crown Customs
      ~Emits events over AMQP~> Signal Bus
    Berth Scheduler is a container crew: Bosun
      description: Assigns moorings by tide
      -Reads berths from-> Harbor Ledger
      -Reads tides from-> Tide Almanac
    Duty Service is a container crew: Purser
      description: Works out cargo duties
      -Writes receipts to-> Harbor Ledger
      -Banks tolls with-> Treasure Bank
    Harbor Ledger is a container is a database crew: Monkeys
      description: Berths and toll receipts
    Chart Cache is a container is a cache crew: Bosun
      description: Tide tables cache
    Signal Bus is a container is a queue crew: Monkeys
      description: Berth and duty events
